@patterns

Purpose:
  Reusable software design patterns.

Use this index before applying a known pattern.

Patterns:
  @patterns.repository
      Abstraction over data source.

  @patterns.strategy
      Interchangeable algorithm family.

  @patterns.factory
      Object creation without specifying exact class.

  @patterns.observer
      One-to-many dependency notification.

  @patterns.decorator
      Add behavior without modifying original.

  @patterns.command
      Encapsulate request as object.

DecisionGuide:
  Need to abstract data source?
    → @patterns.repository

  Need interchangeable behavior?
    → @patterns.strategy

  Need flexible object creation?
    → @patterns.factory

  Need event notification?
    → @patterns.observer

  Need to add behavior dynamically?
    → @patterns.decorator

  Need to parameterize actions?
    → @patterns.command

RelatedReferences:
  @ddd.repository
  @architecture.hexagonal

State: +
